# Per-package changelogs are written by Callisto at release time, which does not run oxfmt. oxfmt 0.73 rewrites its
# nested-list output (whitespace-only lines, blank line between entries), which would fail every release PR's check.
# The root CHANGELOG.md is hand-written and stays formatted.
crates/*/CHANGELOG.md
packages/*/CHANGELOG.md

